.TH proc_sysvipc 5 2026\-02\-08 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
/proc/sysvipc/ \- System V IPC
.SH 説明
.TP 
\fI/proc/sysvipc/\fP
Subdirectory containing the pseudo\-files \fImsg\fP, \fIsem\fP and \fIshm\fP.  These
files list the System V Interprocess Communication (IPC) objects
(respectively: message queues, semaphores, and shared memory)  that
currently exist on the system, providing similar information to that
available via \fBipcs\fP(1).  These files have headers and are formatted (one
IPC object per line)  for easy understanding.  \fBsysvipc\fP(7)  provides
further background on the information shown by these files.
.SH 関連項目
\fBproc\fP(5)
